# The planeswalker that deals the damage must still be a legal target as Compel Brutality resolves (CR 608.2b). Bot1 aims
# Liliana of the Veil (loyalty 3) at Bot2's Oko (loyalty 4); Bot2 destroys Liliana in response with Get Lost (Bot1 gets two Map
# tokens). Liliana can no longer deal damage though Oko is still a legal target, so Oko keeps all 4 loyalty counters, and
# Compel Brutality still goes to the graveyard (the Oko untouched is the proof the damage did not come from anywhere else).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Liliana of the Veil
Compel Brutality
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Oko, Thief of Crowns
Get Lost
Island x14

